#: ../../webgis-src/chb5_mapserver-wms/sec04_getfeatureinfo/section.rst:4
msgid "WMS GetFeatureInfo access"
msgstr "WMS获取要素信息访问权限"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb5_mapserver-wms/sec04_getfeatureinfo/section.rst:6
msgid ""
"The ``GetFeatureInfo`` operation (optional) returns information about "
"features near the specified point on the map. Allows users to click on a "
"pixel to query a feature’s schema and metadata."
msgstr "这个  ``GetFeatureInfo`` 操作(可选)返回有关地图上指定点附近要素的信息。允许用户单击像素以查询要素的方案和元数据。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb5_mapserver-wms/sec04_getfeatureinfo/section.rst:10
msgid ""
"``GetFeatureInfo`` is an optional operation. This operation is only "
"supported for layers with the attribute ``queryable=\"1\"`` (true). If a "
"WMS client makes a request to a layer that does not support this "
"operation, a formatted service exception will be returned."
msgstr ""
"``GetFeatureInfo`` 是一个可选操作。仅具有属性的图层支持此操作  ``queryable=\"1\"`` "
"(True)。如果WMS客户端向不支持此操作的层发出请求，将返回格式化的服务异常。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb5_mapserver-wms/sec04_getfeatureinfo/section.rst:15
msgid ""
"TA WMS may provide the optional ``GetFeatureInfo`` operation, and a WMS "
"that provides this operation calls its map “queryable”. The client can "
"add a position parameter (such as (X, Y) value, that is, the offset from "
"the upper left corner of the picture) or the number of elements that need"
" to query information near the point, to the URL of the requested map, "
"information about the corresponding feature on the map can now be "
"requested."
msgstr ""
"TA WMS可以提供可选的  ``GetFeatureInfo`` "
"操作，提供此操作的WMS将其地图称为“可查询的”。客户端可以将位置参数(如(X，Y)值，即距图片左上角的偏移量)或需要查询点附近信息的元素的数量添加到所请求的地图的URL中，现在可以请求有关地图上相应要素的信息。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb5_mapserver-wms/sec04_getfeatureinfo/section.rst:23
msgid ""
"Since WMS is stateless, the ``GetFeatureInfo`` request should also "
"include all the parameters in the original ``GetMap`` request (except "
"Version and Request). Based on the spatial context information (BBOX, "
"SRS, Width and Height) in the ``GetMap`` request and the ``(X, Y)`` "
"location selected by the user, the WMS returns more information about "
"that location."
msgstr ""
"由于WMS是无状态的，因此  ``GetFeatureInfo`` 请求还应包括原始中的所有参数  ``GetMap`` "
"请求(版本和请求除外)。中的空间上下文信息(BBox、SRS、宽度和高度)  ``GetMap`` 请求和  ``(X, Y)`` "
"用户选择的位置，则WMS返回有关该位置的更多信息。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb5_mapserver-wms/sec04_getfeatureinfo/section.rst:30
msgid ""
"Also included in the ``GetFeatureInfo`` request parameter is the "
"``Query_Layers`` parameter, which specifies the layers from which feature"
" information is obtained. The layers in this parameter list must be those"
" contained in the WMS ``Capabilities`` XML document."
msgstr ""
"也包括在  ``GetFeatureInfo`` 请求参数是  ``Query_Layers`` "
"参数，该参数指定从中获取要素信息的层。此参数列表中的图层必须是WMS中包含的那些  ``Capabilities`` XML文档。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb5_mapserver-wms/sec04_getfeatureinfo/section.rst:35
msgid ""
"The optional ``Info_Format`` parameter in the ``GetFeatureInfo`` request "
"specifies the format in which the feature’s information is returned. The "
"format is defined as a MIME type in the WMS ``Capabilities`` XML "
"document. Such as ``Info_Format=application/vnd.ogc.gml`` table does not "
"return results described in GML."
msgstr ""
"可选的  ``Info_Format`` 参数中的  ``GetFeatureInfo`` "
"请求指定返回功能信息的格式。该格式在WMS中定义为MIME类型  ``Capabilities`` XML文档。比如  "
"``Info_Format=application/vnd.ogc.gml`` 表不返回以GML描述的结果。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb5_mapserver-wms/sec04_getfeatureinfo/section.rst:41
msgid ""
"The optional ``Feature_Count`` parameter in the ``GetFeatureInfo`` "
"request indicates the maximum number of features to return feature "
"information. The default value is ``1`` . The ``X,Y`` parameters "
"represent the pixel coordinates of the point of interest on the map. The "
"``X,Y`` values are within the ``Width`` and ``Height`` parameter values, "
"respectively. The origin of the coordinates is in the upper left corner "
"of the picture."
msgstr ""
"可选的  ``Feature_Count`` 参数中的  ``GetFeatureInfo`` 请求指示返回功能信息的功能的最大数量。缺省值为  "
"``1`` 。这个  ``X,Y`` 参数表示地图上兴趣点的像素坐标。这个  ``X,Y`` 值在  ``Width`` 和  "
"``Height`` 参数值。坐标的原点在图片的左上角。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb5_mapserver-wms/sec04_getfeatureinfo/section.rst:49
msgid ""
"If ``GetFeatureInfo`` request is valid, WMS will respond according to "
"``Info_Format``. The nature of the response will be at the discretion of "
"the WMS server, but generally corresponds to the closest element to the "
"point ``(X,Y)``."
msgstr ""
"如果  ``GetFeatureInfo`` 请求有效，WMS将根据  ``Info_Format`` "
"。响应的性质将由WMS服务器决定，但通常对应于与点最接近的元素  ``(X,Y)`` 。"

